  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indo-Pacific Humanitarian Mechanism Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indo-Pacific Humanitarian Mechanism (IPHM) will strengthen FCDO agility in preparing and responding quickly to new disasters in the Indo-Pacific.  It will deliver one of the International Development Strategy&#x2019;s top priorities: providing life-saving humanitarian assistance and preventing the worst forms of human suffering and the International Development White Paper&#x2019;s emphasis on better preparedness in disaster response.</narrative>
  </description>
